---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Suppliers · RoboWiki" description="Community field reports on machining and component suppliers.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4 py-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">Suppliers</h1>
    <p class="text-base leading-7 text-ink-2">
      Suppliers are separate from the parts library. Parts compare <strong>specs</strong>; suppliers
      compare <strong>who is reliable</strong>: machining quality, lead time, price tier and whether
      they can issue an invoice.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-ink-2">
      Quality, lead time and price are relayed field reports, not vendor claims, marked tier B.
      Personal signatures have been removed.
    </p>
    <a href="/suppliers.html" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-lg bg-brand px-5 text-sm font-medium text-brand-fg hover:bg-slate-700">Open the supplier list →</a>
  </section>
</Base>
